{"ticker":"GUJENERGY","symbol":"GUJENERGY","instrumentId":3022450,"name":"Gujarat Energy","industry":"NSE-Utility-Gas Distribution","about":"Gujarat Gas Limited (GGL) is India’s leading City Gas Distribution (CGD) company, operating across 44 districts in Gujarat, Maharashtra, Rajasthan, Haryana, Punjab, Madhya Pradesh, and Dadra & Nagar Haveli. The company has an extensive natural gas pipeline network of over 40,200 km, distributing approximately 11 mmscmd of natural gas. GGL operates 811 CNG stations and serves over 21.52 lakh households, 15,200 commercial customers, and 4,400 industrial customers. Recognized for its operational excellence, GGL has received several accolades, including 'World’s Most Trustworthy Companies 2023'. It also pioneered green hydrogen blending with Piped Natural Gas, contributing to India’s Natural Gas vision.","website":"www.gujaratgas.com","location":"Ahmedabad, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:24:38.612Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":225.52,"changePct":1.2344570633388696,"week52High":376.1515,"week52Low":208.1},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹21,159 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹28,617 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"572,320,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"283"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"312,165,982"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"3.95%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"0.38"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"16.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.21"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.78"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-1%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"9.55"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"14–39"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"10.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"86.61"},{"label":"Volume","value":"583,079"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,459,264"},{"label":"Master score","value":"44"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"76"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"13"},{"label":"Group rank",